  "description_html": "Size comparison between the Tyrannosaurid dinosaur specimen IVPP V4878 and a human. IVPP V4878 was described by Dong in 1977 as <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Shanshanosaurus&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shanshanosaurus (page does not exist)\">Shanshanosaurus</a> houyanshanensis</i>. It is now known to be a juvenile <i><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Tarbosaurus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tarbosaurus\">Tarbosaurus</a></i>. \n<p><b>References.</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>image:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070110004506/www.paleograveyard.com/shanshanosaurus.html\">Skeletal diagram</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Image:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://media.photobucket.com/image/shanshanosaurus/ddk_inferno/Shanshanosaurus.jpg?o=1\">Skeletal diagram</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Image:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://home.online.no/~padron/shanshan.jpg\">Drawing of some known fragments from the skull</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Image:</b><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://media.photobucket.com/image/shanshanosaurus/Qilongia/RaptorexShanshanTarbo.jpg\">Comparison between skull fragments from not fully grown <i>Tarbosaurus</i> (A. and B.), IVPP V4878 (C.) and a <i>Raptorex</i> (D.). The scale is 5 cm</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Textmaterial:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://qilong.wordpress.com/2009/09/22/the-littlest-big-rex/\">Text about a comparison of the skulls from IVPP V4878 (\"Shanshanosaurus\") and <i>Raptorex</i></a>.</li></ul>",
